                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238568642",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198046753298",
                            "num_reviews": 7,
                            "playtime_forever": 2213,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2213,
                            "playtime_at_review": 2041,
                            "last_played": 1793825866
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "In terms of player count, this game might be considered \"dead.\"\nBut since:\n\n- Lobbies are peer-to-peer.\n- People can join your lobby mid-game.\n- Matchmaking uses the Steam API.\n- Booster cards are safely kept in your Steam Inventory.\n- Other data is saved locally and in the Steam Cloud.\n\nThis game will be around as long as Steam itself is around.\nIt won't be taken away from you by offline servers or discontinued support.\n\nThat kind of self-sufficiency is very rare. Only a few co-op games on Steam are this independent from the developers. I wish this kind of community ownership was more prevalent.\n\nDon't let the player count discourage you from buying this.\nThe community is small, but the players are kind to each other.\nIf you bring at least one friend, you won't be alone from the start.\nOther people join regularly, so you barely notice the low player count.\nIf you find yourself alone in a lobby regardless, try again in the evening, the weekend, or when the game is on sale. \n",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792958814,
